<%# Hero decoded sample.
    Renders a compact, interactive hex view of a featured mainnet account.
    Hidden on mobile via `hidden md:block` (a 16-byte hex row exceeds a
    375px viewport). Caller controls the surrounding layout (the landing
    hero uses a 2-column grid; this partial does not constrain its width).
    Locals: account — an AccountPresenter instance. %>
<div class="hidden md:block">
  <p class="text-gray-500 mb-3" style="font-size:10px">
    USDC mint, decoded — hover any byte
  </p>
  <%= render "accounts/hex_view", account: account, compact: true %>
</div>
